nly for themselves (without first offering to Me, or sharing with others), in truth, eat sin . The physical body of living beings is made up of and sustained by food; food is created by God from five basic elements. God is pleased by the sacrifice (Qurbani) of self-interest: The selfless philanthropic work, and blesses selfless persons. Selfless work or sacrifice is our duty. Duty is prescribed in the scriptures. The scriptures come from God. Thus, the all-pervading God is ever present in selfless service, Seva. One who does not help to keep the wheel of creation in motion by sacrificial duty and who rejoices sense pleasures only, that sinful person lives in vain, O Arjuna.","start":97.128,"dur":92.688,"words":[[0.087,0.463,"Brahma"],[0.8,0.062,"the"],[0.875,0.512,"creator"],[1.8,0.113,"in"],[1.925,0.087,"the"],[2.025,0.412,"beginning"],[2.45,0.425,"created"],[2.888,0.338,"human"],[3.225,0.362,"beings"],[3.6,0.45,"together"],[4.05,0.163,"with"],[4.225,0.525,"selfless"],[4.75,0.487,"service"],[5.6,0.425,"Seva"],[6.45,0.738,"sacrifice"],[7.537,0.125,"and"],[7.675,0.362,"said"],[8.488,0.15,"By"],[8.65,0.562,"Seva"],[9.225,0.188,"or"],[9.425,0.713,"sacrifice"],[10.15,0.1,"of"],[10.262,0.725,"self-interest"],[10.988,0.087,"you"],[11.088,0.237,"shall"],[11.338,0.562,"prosper"],[12.287,0.138,"and"],[12.438,0.338,"Seva"],[12.787,0.4,"shall"],[13.2,0.625,"fulfill"],[13.9,0.225,"all"],[14.137,0.125,"your"],[14.275,0.688,"desires"],[15.375,0.225,"Help"],[15.6,0.1,"the"],[15.713,0.6,"celestial"],[16.325,0.65,"controllers"],[17.188,0.575,"Devas"],[18.137,0.188,"with"],[18.337,0.45,"selfless"],[18.788,0.425,"service"],[19.325,0.212,"and"],[19.55,0.1,"they"],[19.65,0.1,"will"],[19.762,0.2,"help"],[19.975,0.312,"you"],[20.675,0.287,"Thus"],[20.962,0.362,"helping"],[21.337,0.15,"each"],[21.5,0.3,"other"],[22.262,0.075,"you"],[22.35,0.45,"shall"],[22.812,0.412,"attain"],[23.238,0.087,"the"],[23.325,0.55,"Supreme"],[23.887,0.4,"goal"],[24.375,0.113,"of"],[24.488,0.4,"human"],[24.9,0.4